Title: Amery Ice Shelf - hot water drill borehole, AM03 Seabird MicroCAT CTD moorings at three depths in ocean cavity beneath the shelf - 2011/2012 data

Authors:
  - STEFAN VOGEL (INVESTIGATOR, TECHNICAL CONTACT)
  - DAVE CONNELL (TECHNICAL CONTACT, DIF AUTHOR)

Owner: Commonwealth of Australia

Citation: Vogel, S. (2015) Amery Ice Shelf - hot water drill borehole, AM03 Seabird MicroCAT CTD moorings at three depths in ocean cavity beneath the shelf - 2011/2012 data, Ver. 1,  <em>Australian Antarctic Data Centre</em> - <a href="https://data.aad.gov.au/metadata/records/AAS_4096_AM03_MicroCAT">https://data.aad.gov.au/metadata/records/AAS_4096_AM03_MicroCAT</a>, Accessed: 2020-07-02

Revision Date: 2019-03-13

Metadata URL: https://data.aad.gov.au/metadata/records/AAS_4096_AM03_MicroCAT

Dataset API URL: https://data.aad.gov.au/s3/api/bucket/datasets/science/AAS_4096_AM03_MicroCAT?export=json

Abstract: AM03 borehole drilled December 2005.

Data being collected at annual re-visits to site.

Consult Readme file for detail of data files and formats.  A word document providing further information is also available as part of the download.

All of the .dat files of data can be viewed with a text editor such as Wordpad.

2011-2012 data may be final data from the unit owing to battery failure.

The original project for this dataset was ASAC 1164, but recent data fall under the auspices of project AAS 4096.

Use Constraints: This data set conforms to the CCBY Attribution License (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

Please follow instructions listed in the citation reference provided at http://data.aad.gov.au/aadc/metadata/citation.cfm?entry_id=AAS_4096_AM03_MicroCAT when using these data.

